<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Fahad Jamil - Portfolio</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background-color: #f4f4f9;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #1a252f;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        nav .logo {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
        }

        nav ul li a {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        nav ul li a:hover {
            background-color: #2c3e50;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        /* Sections */
        section {
            padding: 5rem 2rem 3rem;
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        h2 {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            color: #2c3e50;
            position: relative;
        }

        h2::after {
            content: '';
            display: block;
            width: 50px;
            height: 3px;
            background: #3498db;
            margin: 0.5rem auto 0;
        }

        /* About Section */
        #about p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Skills Section */
        .skills-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .skill-card {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #3498db;
        }

        /* Projects Section */
        .projects-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .project-card {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .project-card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: #2c3e50;
        }

        .project-card a {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 0.75rem;
            color: #3498db;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .project-card a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        /* Recommendations Section */
        .recommendations-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .recommendation-card {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 4px solid #3498db;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .recommendation-card span {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            font-style: normal;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: right;
            color: #7f8c8d;
        }

        /* Form */
        .add-recommendation-form {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .form-group input, .form-group textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        button {
            background: #3498db;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1rem;
            width: 100%;
        }

        button:hover {
            background: #2980b9;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">Fahad Jamil</div>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#about">About Me</a></li>
            <li><a href="#skills">Skills</a></li>
            <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
            <li><a href="#recommendations">Recommendations</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- About Me -->
    <section id="about">
        <h2>About Me</h2>
        <p>
            Hi! I am Fahad Jamil, a software developer passionate about building web applications and cross-platform mobile solutions. 
            I work across the stack using Python, Django, Flutter, and iOS, focusing on clean code, Git workflow best practices, and practical problem-solving.
        </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Skills -->
    <section id="skills">
        <h2>Skills</h2>
        <div class="skills-container">
            <div class="skill-card">HTML5 & CSS3</div>
            <div class="skill-card">JavaScript</div>
            <div class="skill-card">Python</div>
            <div class="skill-card">Django</div>
            <div class="skill-card">Flutter</div>
            <div class="skill-card">iOS Development</div>
            <div class="skill-card">Git & GitHub</div>
            <div class="skill-card">Shell Scripting</div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Projects -->
    <section id="projects">
        <h2>Projects</h2>
        <div class="projects-grid">
            <div class="project-card">
                <h3>Simple Interest Calculator</h3>
                <p>A Bash shell script project hosted in <code>github-final-project</code> designed to compute simple interest on principal amounts. Fully configured with standard open-source documentation including a README, Apache 2.0 license, and contributing guidelines.</p>
                <a href="https://github.com/fahadjamilfj-beep/github-final-project" target="_blank">View on GitHub &rarr;</a>
            </div>
            <div class="project-card">
                <h3>Flutter Simple Interest App</h3>
                <p>A single-file cross-platform mobile application developed using Flutter for calculating simple interest on Android and iOS devices.</p>
                <a href="https://github.com/fahadjamilfj-beep" target="_blank">View on GitHub &rarr;</a>
            </div>
            <div class="project-card">
                <h3>Developer Portfolio Website</h3>
                <p>A responsive single-page portfolio built with HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript, featuring interactive navigation and dynamic recommendations.</p>
                <a href="https://github.com/fahadjamilfj-beep" target="_blank">View on GitHub &rarr;</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Recommendations -->
    <section id="recommendations">
        <h2>Recommendations</h2>
        <div class="recommendations-container" id="recommendations-list">
            <div class="recommendation-card">
                "Fahad demonstrates strong technical proficiency across web and mobile development. His project workflows on GitHub are exceptionally well-organized."
                <span>- Peer Reviewer</span>
            </div>
            <div class="recommendation-card">
                "Fahad is dependable, quick to adapt to new frameworks like Flutter and Django, and consistently delivers clean code."
                <span>- Course Instructor</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="add-recommendation-form">
            <h3 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Leave a Recommendation</h3>
            <form id="recommendationForm">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="recommenderName">Your Name</label>
                    <input type="text" id="recommenderName" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="recommendationText">Recommendation</label>
                    <textarea id="recommendationText" rows="4" required></textarea>
                </div>
                <button type="submit">Submit Recommendation</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>

    <script>
        document.getElementById('recommendationForm').addEventListener('submit', function(event) {
            event.preventDefault();

            const nameInput = document.getElementById('recommenderName');
            const textInput = document.getElementById('recommendationText');

            const name = nameInput.value.trim();
            const text = textInput.value.trim();

            if (name && text) {
                const newCard = document.createElement('div');
                newCard.classList.add('recommendation-card');
                newCard.innerHTML = `"${text}" <span>- ${name}</span>`;

                document.getElementById('recommendations-list').appendChild(newCard);

                nameInput.value = '';
                textInput.value = '';

                alert('Thank you for submitting a recommendation!');
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>